									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px; color: #444;" valign="top" width="570">
									<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;"><strong>Subject: Pet Policy Reminder</strong><br />
									<br />
									We&#39;re proud to be one of the few pet-friendly property management companies&nbsp;in Winnipeg&nbsp;as we know that your pet is a part of your family! Please take a moment to review a few essential policies regarding your pets.&nbsp;</span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">All pets must be approved by Thorwin Properties. If you moved in without a pet, and you&#39;re now thinking about adding a pet to your home, please reach out to your Property Manager or Resident Community&nbsp;Manager.</span></span></li>
										<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Ensure that your cat or dog is on a leash anytime they are not securely within your apartment home.&nbsp;</span></span></li>
										<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Pick up your dog&#39;s waste immediately every time, dog waste bags are supplied at many of our communities. Reach out to your Resident Community Manager to find out where they are located.</span></span></li>
										<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Remember you are responsible for your pets and their behavior at all times. If your dog likes to bark, you should investigate barking suppression products. Many options are cruelty-free.</span></span></li>
										<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Cat litter&nbsp;boxes should be cleaned a couple of times a week and no less than once a week. Cat litter should be taken to outdoor bins if your community has a garbage chute.&nbsp;Your cat and your neighbors will thank you for keeping it clean!&nbsp;</span></span></li>
									</ul>

									<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">For the full Thorwin Properties pet policy, please visit&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.rentcafe.com/t/el?ref=NTQyMTMyNDIxNg%3d%3d-ZR8Th6cC91s%3d,aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhvcndpbi5jYS9vdXJwZXRwb2xpY3kuYXNweA%3d%3d-eXiOsV7HuAU%3d" ><span style="color:#3498db;">Thorwin Properties Pet Policy</span></a>.&nbsp;</span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Sincerely,&nbsp;<br />
									Thorwin Properties</span></span></p>
									</td>
