									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px; color: #444;" valign="top" width="570"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>Subject:&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Resident Referral Program</b></span></span></span></span>
									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><br />
									<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Family &amp; Friends Make Good Neighbors!</b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><br />
									<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Unlock $500 with our Resident Referral Program.</b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Love where you live? Share the joy and earn rewards!</span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Refer a friend to any of our Thorwin communities, and when they move in, you&rsquo;ll receive a <b>$500 Referral Bonus</b> toward your next month&rsquo;s rent &mdash; it&rsquo;s that simple!</span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>How It Works:</b></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<ol>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>How to Refer:</b> Tell your friends, family, or colleagues about our vibrant community. <i>Let your Resident Manager or Leasing Team know before they tour or apply.</i></span></span></span></span><br />
										&nbsp;</li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>They Apply &amp; Move In: </b>Your referral must complete the lease process. </span></span></span></span><br />
										&nbsp;</li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Get $500:</b> Once they move in, we&rsquo;ll apply your $500 bonus to your next month&rsquo;s rent!</span></span></span></span></li>
									</ol>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Why Refer?</b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Help your friends find their perfect apartment home.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">There&rsquo;s no limit to how many friends you can refer&mdash; the more, the better!</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Earn rewards while sharing the amazing living experience at Thorwin.</span></span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Policy Details:</b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Referral must be a new applicant (not a past visitor or current resident). &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Your name must be mentioned before the tour and application. </span></span></span></span></li>
										<li style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">Bonus is applied after move-in. Other conditions may apply.</span></span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>Ready to Start Earning?</b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b><i>Refer a friend today and help them explore the wonderful apartment homes in our Thorwin community. Plus, enjoy a $500 credit applied directly to your rent for next month!</i></b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm">&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">For more information, contact our office. Join the fun and start referring today!</span></span></span></span></p>

									<p>&nbsp;</p>
									<br />
									<span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">Sincerely,&nbsp;<br />
									Thorwin Properties</span></span></td>
								</tr>
