									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px;" valign="top" width="570">
									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Subject: Nuisance &amp; Disturbance</span></b></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">We would like to remind&nbsp;residents&nbsp;to avoid behaviors&nbsp;that interfere with other residents&rsquo; enjoyment of their home.&nbsp;This includes, but is not limited to, loud parties, music, barking dogs, and loud conversations in the common areas. Nuisance and disturbance can be any time of the day, but specifically during quiet hours, which go from 9:00 pm to 7:00 am.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><br />
									<br />
									<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Residents should&nbsp;let management know when their neighbor is causing a disturbance. If the noise is extreme, please contact the Winnipeg Police non-emergency number at&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"><a href="mailto:(204) 986-6222"><span style="color:#000000;">(204) 986-6222</span></a></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">We appreciate your assistance in keeping Thorwin Properties community&nbsp;a place where people can work, study, rest and enjoy themselves harmoniously.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
									<br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<div style="text-align:center"><img alt="" height="134" src="https://cdngeneralcf.rentcafe.com//dmslivecafe/UploadedImages/9d1dd97a-80b6-45f2-b080-dba3151cd44f.jpg" width="200" /></div>

									<p style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Sincerely,</span><br />
									<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Thorwin Properties</span></span></span></span></span></p>
