									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px;" valign="top" width="570">
									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Subject: No Smoking Policy Reminder </span></b></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<div style="text-align:center"><img alt="" height="100" src="https://sonomacounty.ca.gov/Ektron%20Images/uploadedImages/Sonoma/Health_Services/_Images/_content/graphic-no-smoke-vape-marijuana-480.jpg" width="100" /></div>

									<p><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Thorwin Properties has a no smoking policy because it&nbsp;<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">is one of the leading causes of house fires, it<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&nbsp;causes damage to the apartment home, and s<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">econd-hand smoke&nbsp;is unhealthy for both our residents and their&nbsp;pets.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Smoking means inhaling, exhaling, burning, or carrying any lighted cigar, cigarette, cannabis, or any similar product whose use generates smoke, fumes, or vapor.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">You are </span><b><u><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">not</span></u></b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> allowed to smoke/vape inside your home, even on your balcony, if you have one. This is grounds for eviction.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">You are only allowed to smoke 8 meters away from any entrance as per City of Winnipeg By-Law 62/2011.</span></span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

