									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">If you do not already have a parking stall or choose to have an additional parking stall, kindly note we have many available parking options throughout the city.</span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">Should residents or guests thereof be interested, please contact your Resident Manager or Property Manager directly for more details. </span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">As our available parking stalls are quickly filling at this time of year, you are best served to act fast before the weather turns and the City of Winnipeg issues their seasonal street parking bans.</span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">We look forward to hearing from you, and please know we value your tenancy.</span></span></span></p>
