									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>Subject:&nbsp;Holiday Office Hours</strong></span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">As we approach the holiday season, we wanted to share our upcoming office closure schedule:</span></span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>December 13th</strong>: Closing at noon for our end-of-year staff event</span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>December 24th</strong>: Closing at noon</span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>December 25th &amp; 26th</strong>: Closed all day</span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>January 1st</strong>: Closed all day</span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

									<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#000000;">During these times, our on-call emergency service will be available at&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:(204) 222–2422"><a href="mailto:(204) 222–2422"><span style="color:#000000;">(204) 222&ndash;2422</span></a><span style="color:#000000;"></a>&nbsp;for any urgent needs.</span></span></span><br />
									<br />
									<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">Thank you for your understanding, and we wish you a joyful holiday season!</span></span><br />
									<br />
									<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">Kind regards,<br />
									Thorwin Properties</span></span></span></p>
