									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px;" valign="top" width="570">
									<p style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Subject: Laundry Etiquette&nbsp;</strong><br />
									<br />
									Thorwin Properties needs your help in keeping our laundry rooms fully functioning and inviting for all users.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>

									<ul style="">
										<li style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Should you notice a machine is not working call Coinamatic at 1-800-561-1972 or vis</span></span></span><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">it&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:https://coinamatic.com/service-request/" style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;">https://coinamatic.com/service-request/</span></a><font color="#000000">&nbsp;as soon as possible. Place the out of order sign on the machine, so others do not try to use it until it&#39;s repaired.&nbsp;</font></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Do not overload&nbsp;the machines as it will cause mechanical issues.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Use laundry bags for delicates to prevent small items from getting trapped or clogging the machine.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Do not use bleach in the machines, it can cause irritation and staining for other users.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Wipe down the inside of the rubber seals on front loading washing machines and leave the door open after you&#39;re done your laundry.</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Use a timer and remove laundry promptly after each wash and dry cycle.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Clean the lint trap after every dry cycle.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Do not remove other resident&#39;s&nbsp;clothes from the machines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Wipe up any spilled detergent and&nbsp;throw away dryer sheets or other debris.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>
										<li style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Replacement laundry cards can be purchased at the card loading stations.</span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

