									<span style="color:black">To ensure we are here for you 24/7 we have an emergency phone line available. For your convenience our regular office phone number is forwarded to the on-call service company whenever the office is closed.<br />
									<br />
									To ensure the most efficient service we ask that calls be limited to emergencies only. Please take a moment to review some examples of issues that should be reported to the emergency on-call phone line. The on-call service company will connect with either your Resident Community Manager or Property Manager when there are after hours emergencies. </span></span></span></p>

									<p><br />
									<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:black">No Heat<br />
									No Water<br />
									Major leaks (ceiling, taps, rads etc.)<br />
									Major flooding<br />
									Sewer back up<br />
									Toilet clogged when there is only 1 bathroom in the home<br />
									Locked out with no access, or security doors not locking/broken<br />
									Fire (always call 911 before the emergency line)</span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:black">The below list is some examples of issues that are not emergencies and should be reported through the maintenance request option on your resident portal. While these issues are important, we ask that you help create work life balance by not reporting these issues to the on-call service.<br />
									<br />
									Snow clearing<br />
									Minor leaks of taps and appliances<br />
									Sink clogged<br />
									Breaker requiring reset due to overload<br />
									Stove not working<br />
									Burnt out light bulbs<br />
									Anything related to rent payments (this should be reported to your Property Manager)<br />
									Power outage (contact Manitoba Hydro)<br />
									Parking stall unavailable (contact your Resident Community Manager)<br />
									Laundry machines (contact the phone number on the machines)<br />
									<br />
									Thank you for assisting us in providing exceptional service. </span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:black">Sincerely,<br />
									Thorwin Properties</span></span></span></p>
									</td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#ffffff" height="15" width="600">&nbsp;</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
