									<td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" class="full_width" style="padding: 15px;" valign="top" width="570">
									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Subject: Early Termination and Lease Assignment</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p style="text-align: justify;"><br />
									<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">We at Thorwin Properties understand that sometimes life happens and your need to move may not conveniently line up with the end of your lease.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">If this ever happens, these are your options:</span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Option 1 &ndash; Assign your lease to someone else. With this option, you would be responsible for advertising and showing your apartment home to prospective residents. You must continue to pay&nbsp;the rent until another resident has moved in.&nbsp;This option has a $75.00 administration fee.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Option 2 &ndash; Early Termination of Lease. This option is for residents that do not want the hassle of advertising and showing their suite. It is as simple as giving&nbsp;two full calendar months notice and paying a fee equivalent to half a month&#39;s rent.</span><br />
									<br />
									<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Option 3 - Transfer within Thorwin Properties. We would love to keep you as a resident and your Property Manager is able to discuss all upcoming apartment home vacancies within our portfolio. This option has a $75.00 administration fee.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Thank you for choosing Thorwin Properties as the place you call home.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Sincerely,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

