									<div style="text-align:center"><img alt="" height="151" src="https://cdngeneralcf.rentcafe.com//dmslivecafe/2/128018/EmailTemplatesDragDropUploads/668991cc-841b-4c59-b690-ddae36eb05bf.png" width="150" /></div>

									<p><br />
									<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Thorwin Properties encourages all residents to participate in keeping the community safe&nbsp;and preventing incidents.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>

									<ul>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Ensure that all doors are completely closed&nbsp;behind you when entering or exiting the building.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Make sure no one follows you into the building that you do not know, which includes delivery people or someone claiming to be visiting another apartment home.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Never &quot;buzz&quot; anyone in that you aren&#39;t expecting.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Keep your apartment door locked at all times.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Keep your car doors locked and make sure there are no valuables in your vehicle.</span></span></span></span></li>
										<li><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Do not keep valuables in your storage locker.</span></span></span></span></li>
									</ul>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Please immediately report any suspicious activity to your Resident Manager and the non-emergency police line, 204‑986‑6222.</span></span></span></span><br />
									&nbsp;</p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Sincerely,</span></span></span></span></span></p>

									<p><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Thorwin Properties</span></span></span></span></span></p>
									</td>
