									<p><br />
									<span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:normal">On Friday, January 26, 2024, between 12:00 pm and 4:00 pm, annual fire alarm inspections will be conducted. Entry to all apartment homes is mandatory and will not be rescheduled.&nbsp;<br />
